{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14420","headline":"早春曲 · 戴叔伦","name":"早春曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青楼昨夜东风转，锦帐凝寒觉春浅。\n垂杨摇丝莺乱啼，褭褭烟光不堪翦。\n博山吹云龙脑香，铜壶滴愁更漏长。\n玉颊啼红梦初醒，羞见青鸾镜中影。\n侬家少年爱游逸，万里轮蹄去无迹。\n朱颜未衰消息稀，肠断天涯草空碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}